The dish is a paper plate about 18-20 cm across (roughly 260 px wide in the image). I count about 30 almonds on it.

A raw almond weighs about 1.2 g, so 30 almonds come to roughly 36 g. At about 5.8 kcal/g (almonds run around 575-600 kcal per 100 g), that is about 210 kcal.

